      "source": "https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dcnr/recreation/where-to-go/state-parks/find-a-park/codorus-state-park/history"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Iron ore found near Pigeon Hills in 1752 led to Mary Ann Furnace, built 1762, the first charcoal furnace west of the Susquehanna.",
